##
## Pipeline:
##   1. Run Google Colab notebook (scripts/LingBot_World_Colab_Pipeline.ipynb)
##   2. Download zip → extract to assets/references/lingbot/
##   3. This module loads videos/textures for in-engine reference display
##   4. Visual prompts feed into loading screens, skyboxes, and environment previews

